icial [4d1f26e1f], v4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6], v4.0.stable.official [92bee43ad]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable - Linux Mint 22.1 (Xia) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated Intel(R) Arc(tm) A750 Graphics (DG2) - AMD Ryzen 5 5600X 6-Core Processor (12 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nNeither the Riffmaster or Rock Band 4 Jaguar PDP guitar controllers are detected by Godot on Linux, while other controllers (such as the Dualsense) work as expected. This can be confirmed by using Input.get_connected_joypads(). Notably, the Windows version of Godot under WINE does detect the controllers, and they function as expected.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Run game-pad-test.zip with a PDP Riffmaster or Rock Band 4 Jaguar Guitar connected to the computer\n- Check the console for device names\nOn Windows (or running via wine), device name shows as expected.\nOn Linux, device name is absent.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[game-pad-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21302682/game-pad-test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_